    <title>Lubbock: data center moratorium — Proposed</title>
    <link>https://aigridwatch.com/communities/lubbock-tx</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">mora-lubbock-tx</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description>Citizen petition for an 18-month moratorium on hyperscale data centers inside city limits, filed by Citizens of Lubbock Against Data Centers (&#x27;Save Lubbock&#x27;) with about 3,000 signatures against a 2,410 threshold; the city verified them. Council takes it up Aug 25, 2026 — and if the council votes it down the measure can go to voters at the November election</description>
